# OD9 Pedagogical Library — protect gated tiers.
#
# Observer + Theorist are public (cold-visitor samples) and stay directly
# accessible. Architect, Pioneer, and Benefactor PDFs are members-only: deny
# all direct HTTP access here and require them through /download.php, which
# verifies the visitor's tier first. download.php reads the files from the
# filesystem (readfile), so it is unaffected by this rule.
#
# bunker/ holds Bunker audio exclusives (Phuryous Stylez Vol. 1); denied here and
# served ONLY through /bunker-audio.php, which verifies login + streams with Range.
RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^(architect|pioneer|benefactor|founding|bunker)/ - [F]
